---
Pre Rup: A Sanskrit Eulogy of the tenth-century Khmer emperor Rājendravarman (K. 806)
E-text after draft of forthcoming re-edition by Dominic Goodall, Harunaga Isaacson, and S.L.P. Anjaneya Sarma, with normalizations and several emendations/conjectures included in the text without being recorded here.

---


ṛgbhirvahniśikhākalāpavisaravyaktābhiraindrīṃ diśaṃ 
prodyadvāyusamīritena yajuṣā yo dīpayandakṣiṇām|
sāmnā caṇḍamarīciraśminikarapradyotitenāparāṃ 
kauberīṃ ca vibhāti taiḥ samuditaistasmai namaḥ śambhave|| 1

oṃkārāditanustanoti jagatāmeko 'pi janmasthitivyastīrvyaktaisamastaśaktinilayo yo yogiyogātmakaḥ| 2ab
bhūyo nīrajajanmakañjanayanaśrīkaṇṭhamūrtirvaśī śabdāntasthitaye śivāya vibhave śāntāya tasmai namaḥ|| 2cd

brāhmīmindau savitrīṃ savitari vitatāṃ vaiṣṇavīṃ pālanīṃ yat
raudrīṃ saṃhārahetuṃ hutabhuji ca kalāmarpayattriprakāram| 
dṛṣṭaṃ dṛkśaktidṛgbhistriṣu racitavapuḥ sūkṣmamapyeṣu tasmai
tattvajñānāṃ parasmai parihṛtarajase brahmaṇe stānnamo vaḥ|| 3

pāresattvarajastamaskamapi yo nityaṃ niviṣṭaḥ pade
traiguṇyena caturvidhena vividhābhivyaktirāvirbhavan|
viśvākaradharo nirastasakalākāro 'pi dedīpyate
vandantāṃ bhagavantamādipuruṣaṃ taṃ vāsudevaṃ vibhum|| 4

ṣaḍgarbhaprabhavāya buddhijananīṃ vidyāṃ vinirmāya yā
garbhe saptamagarbhakarṣaṇakarī haṃsasya sūte 'ṣṭame|
mūrtā kaṃsavadhoddhuraṃ vidadhatī nādaṃ nabhasthordhvagā
sādyā śaktirakṛtrimā bhagavato nārāyaṇī namyatām|| 5

āsīdāsindhusīmasphuritasitayaśorāśisaṃcārarājadrājyaśrīmaṇḍitāninditapuravikasanmātṛvaṃśādhipatyaḥ| 6ab
somākauṇḍinyavaṃśyo 'dadhadanatanṛpadvādaśādityadīptiḥ śrībālādityabhūpo valayamiva bhuvo maṇḍalaṃ līlayā yaḥ|| 6cd

yāṃ viśvarūpabhaṭṭo yo lebhe tadbhaginīsutām| 7ab
patnīṃ sarasvatīṃ vipro vasiṣṭho 'rundhatīmiva|| 7cd

brahmakṣatriyayorvaṃśe pāramparyodite tayoḥ| 8ab
jāyā dvivedabhaṭṭasya jātā vedavatīti yā|| 8cd

yasyāḥ puṇyaguṇasya mātṛjananībhrātustanūjo jitārāteḥ śrīnṛpatīndravarmanṛpateḥ śauryeṇa śaureriva| 9ab
śṛṅge śrījayavarmaṇaḥ kṛtavato māhendraśaile purīṃ māturmātulamātulo 'tulakalaḥ śrīpuṣkarākṣo nṛpaḥ|| 9cd

svargadvāre pure yā puri puri ca purā sthāpitaṃ bhūmibhartrā
śrībālādityanāmnā nijakulatilakenaiśvaraṃ liṅgamiddham|
bhartrā tenaiva vedadvitayamayadṛśā pūjayitvā samastaiḥ 
bhogaiḥ svargapratiṣṭhāmalabhata vilasatkīrtisaṃdīpitāśā|| 10

yā tatkulīnāvanipālavaṃśaparamparāyāmuditā mahatyām| 11ab
mahendradevīti mahīva gurvī devī surastrīva divo 'vatīrṇā|| 11cd

mahīpatervedavatīpituryaḥ kalāṃ kulīnaḥ sakalāṃ dadhānaḥ| 12ab
rājanyavaṃśābdhiniśākaraḥ śrīmahendravarmā mahanīyakīrtiḥ|| 12cd

tenorvībhṛdvarāṅge vidalitatamasā pādavinyāsalīlāṃ 
ātanvānena tasyāṃ narapativanitāmūrdhadhūtāṅghridhūlyām| 13ab
devyāṃ vaivasvatākhyo manuriva raviṇā rājadharmānuraktaḥ 
yaḥ śrīrājendravarmetyajani duhitari tvaṣṭurūrvīpatīndraḥ|| 13cd

prāgvedābhyasanaṃ dvijena janitaṃ śrīviśvarūpeṇa yattaptaṃ yattrividhaṃ tapaḥ saha tayā patnyā dvivedena yat| 14ab
bhūbhṛdbhiśca tadanvaye samuditairyattena tenāṃśumadvaṃśyānāṃ harirādideva iva yo vaṃśe tadīye 'bhavat|| 14cd

saṃjāto vijayī nijena jayinā tejaḥprakarṣeṇa yaḥ 
nīcībhāvitavānaśesamapi saṃstejasvivṛndārakam| 15ab
kenāpi pratipāditākhilamahīsāmrājyasampadguṇān
arkādīnasahiṣṭa bhūrimahasāmuccāśrayānāśrayān|| 15cd

mātuḥ kṣatrivaṃśadugdhajaladherlabdhodayāyāḥ śriyaḥ 
śrībhartuḥ puruṣottamasya ca piturbhāsvatkule bhāsvataḥ| 16ab
kāntyā kāma ivādhiko 'pi niravadyāṅgo 'niruddhaḥ sutaḥ 
yo garbheśvaraśabdamarthyamabhṛtānītaṃ guṇairaiśvaraiḥ|| 16cd

somākhyātsargasārādbhavapurarucirālliṅgamāhlādanatvaṃ 
bālādityātprabhutvaṃ tribhuvanakamalonmīlanāyādadānaḥ 17ab
vahnerdīptiṃ pituḥ svānmahati bhavapure 'pīśvarādīśvaratvaṃ 
devīyuktātkumāro diśi diśi viditaḥ sarvatejomayo yaḥ|| 17cd

durgābhiyogādviphalīkṛtārikāṅkṣaṃ yaśodābhyudayāya dakṣam| 18ab
mahendrato labdhamahābhiṣekaṃ rarāja śaureriva yasya bālyam| 18cd

sattvaṃ guṇaṃ karma dadhānamiddhaṃ sāmānyamanyeṣu viśeṣamicchan| 19ab
vyadhatta dhātā samavāyavṛttyā yasyākhilaṃ lakṣaṇamagryamaṅge|| 19cd

kāmaḥ svakāntidinakṛtkiraṇairvikīrṇaiḥ pītānyakāntijayaśolavapalvalāmbhāḥ| 20ab
yatkāntisāgaramapāramupetya magno manye karoti makaraṃ nijavāhanaṃ yat|| 20cd

vyākhyāmayīmupagamayya hatāndhakārāṃ rākāminaḥ paṭimadīptyanusampraveśāt| 21ab
vidyendumaṇḍalamudīrṇarasāmṛtārdraṃ sarvānapāyayata yo vibudhānrasajñaḥ|| 21cd

yasyāstraśikṣāṃ carataḥ praśaṃsā loke 'karotkarṇamanaḥprasādam| 22ab
karṇapraṇītā mahatī tu nindānuśrūyate 'dyāpi dhanañjayasya|| 22cd

daṇḍaṃ trikhaṇḍaṃ pṛthulaṃ salīlaṃ lulāva lohaṃ kadalīdalābham| 23ab
sakṛtkr.pāṇaṃ laghu pātayanyaḥ kimucyate māṃsamaye 'ridehe|| 23cd

nīlotpalasyāpi dale 'yasīva nāsiśchidāśaktimagātpareṣām| 24ab
yasyaiva mantrauṣadhivīryayogādvajropamāyāṃ kimutāṅgāṣṭau|| 24cd

dhanurdhanurvedavidāṃ varo 'pi vidhūya maurvīravapūritāśaḥ| 25ab
prayogato 'bhijvalitaṃ vipaścidyaścāpaśabdaṃ na cakāra kaṃcit|| 25cd

yasyākalaṅkāḥ sakalāḥ kalālīralaṃkariṣṇoḥ kila bālabhāve| 26ab
candrastulārthīva tulāmalabdhvādhunāpi vṛddhau punareti bālyam|| 26cd

mūrdhābhiṣiktaḥ sukumārabhāvo dṛptadviṣattārakadāriśaktiḥ| 27ab
nināya kīrṇāṃ diśi kambusenāṃ yo devasenāmiva kārtikeyaḥ|| 27cd

sadānavārīkṛtadikprayāto nāgendrabhīmo bhagavāniveśaḥ| 28ab
brāhmairvidhānaiḥ parirakṣito yo bhasmīcakārāripurāṇi roṣāt|| 28cd

śarāntarīkṛtya śarīrayaṣṭīrutkṛtya kṛtsnāni śirāṃsyarīṇām| 29ab
khaḍgī gadābhṛtkarikumbhapeṣī prāduścakārāstramamānuṣaṃ yaḥ|| 29cd

jitvaikavīro diśamindraguptāṃ yo dakṣiṇāṃ dehabhṛtāṃ didīpe| 30ab
prācetasīṃ cetasi sottarāṃ ca na rājasūyāya tu jiṣṇurekām|| 30cd

pratyantapṛthvīṃ sakalāṃ vijitya bālo 'pi yūno nṛpatīnpratāpya| 31ab
pratītayā kambupurīṃ yaśasvī saṃyojayāmāsa jayaśriyā yaḥ|| 31cd

raṇārṇavādyasya jayāmṛtena jātaṃ yaśaḥkaustubharatnamārdram| 32ab
trailokyamāhlādayati tridhaikaṃ mūrtaṃ murārerhṛdayaṃ mudeva|| 32cd

kalābhirāhlādayituṃ samastaṃ lokaṃ vivṛddhābhiranukrameṇa| 33ab
vimuktabālyo 'pi śaśīva sākṣātkalākṣayaṃ yo na babhāra bhūyaḥ|| 33cd

avasthitiṃ śaiśavajāṃ vilupya rājaśriyā saṃgamakāṅkṣayeva| 34ab
stheyo 'tra tiṣṭheti kṛtājñayā yo nīto navaṃ yauvanamādariṇyā|| 34cd

yā kāntiratyanyanarendrasargaśobhā śiśutve dadṛśe nu yasya| 35ab
tāṃ yauvane kartumanāḥ prakṛṣṭāṃ yatnaṃ viriñco nitarāṃ cakāra|| 35cd

vilokya dikpālajale jayāḍhyaṃ jayaśriyāliṅgitamīrṣyayeva| 36ab
yamāliliṅge guruvāṅniyuktā kulocitā kambujarājyalakṣmīḥ|| 36cd

yābhiryato jhaṭiti bhūmibhṛto 'nyarāṣṭre sasraṃsire samararaṅgagatā gṛhītāḥ| 37ab
rājyaśriyaṃ ṣaḍarimūrtibhireva tābhiryastāmadhārayadatatpuruṣaprayogāt|| 37cd

yasyāṅgalagnaṃ vihite 'bhiṣeke tīrthāmbu yāvanna jagāma śoṣam| 38ab
tejo jvalattāvadaśoṣayaddviḍvadhūjanānāmadhare madhūni|| 38cd

jātaṃ varāṅgābharaṇaṃ bhavasya navendumudvīkṣya navārkabimbam| 39ab
cūḍāmaṇībhūya nu yasya serṣyaṃ bhāsā śiro 'rañjayadīśvarasya|| 39cd

dhruvaṃ dharābhāradharasya yasyāhīndro maṇīnbhogasahasradīptān| 40ab
āhṛtya harṣādiva vītabhāro bhūṣāsu haimīṣu babandha sarvān|| 40cd

strīṇāṃ didṛkṣākṣubhitā yadīyaṃ grasatyakṛtte sati kānticandram| 41ab
nimeṣacandradviṣi cakricakrakrudheva raktā dadṛśurdṛśo 'ṃśam|| 41cd

rājyasthitau tribhuvanābhyudayāya yasya yā kāśyapīratirabhūdaditiprabhūtā| 42ab
manvantare surapateriva gopturasminpūrvendrasampadi na sā kṛtasannidhānā|| 42cd

siṃhāsanasthamavalokya mahībhṛtaṃ yaṃ hṛṣṭā mahī sumahatīṃ śriyamānināya| 43ab
siṃhāsane sthitavatī svayameva rāmātsītāṃ śriyaṃ tvapajahāra mahībhṛto 'pi|| 43cd

vistīrṇaratnarucirañjitahemadaṇḍaṃ yasyaikameva śuśubhe sitamātapatram| 44ab
merorivoparigataṃ sakalendubimbaṃ sadbhaktivāriṣu tu tatpratibimbamanyat|| 44cd

nirvikriyāyāṃ prakṛtau kṛtāyāmapyeṣa yasyāvirabhūdvikāraḥ| 45ab
haimīva yadratnamayīva cāsīdraimauliratnairnatabhūbhujāṃ bhūḥ|| 45cd

kṣoṇībhṛtāṃ dīptavatī varāṅgeṣvāhlādanī vāgdahanī ca yasya| 46ab
tejomayī sūryaśaśāṅkavahnisaṃghātatulyākṛta lokayātrām|| 46cd

mādyanti yairanyamahībhṛtastaiḥ śaśāma yo rājyasukhopabhogaiḥ| 47ab
prāvṛṭpravṛddhairjaladāmbuvarṣaiḥ sindhorviparyeti payo hi nābdheḥ|| 47cd

rājanvatītyanyanṛpo 'nvaśātprāṅnipātanāllakṣaṇamantareṇa| 48ab
yo lakṣaṇaiḥ saṃskṛtavarṇavardhipadaistu sādhutvadharāṃ dharitrīm|| 48cd

kulakramaiḥ svairapi rājavidyāṃ dīptāmatītairbhuvi bhāvibhiśca| 49ab
yo 'dīpayatprāpya viśeṣato 'syaṃstamāṃsi madhyāhna ivārkabhāsam|| 49cd

na bhūbhṛto 'bhūtpariṇīya kanyāmekāṃ nu nāke parameśvaraḥ prāk| 50ab
bhūtvā tu bhūyo bhuvi yo 'dhikaśrīḥ kanyāśataṃ bhūradhiketi nākāt|| 50cd

bhrāntāvarugnamṛdukārmukametya rāmaṃ rājyādapetamariṇāpahṛtā purā śrīḥ| 51ab
yaṃ jānakī kila dṛḍhākṣatakārmukaṃ tu rājyasthirasthitimaśakyata nāpahartum|| 51cd

nyakkartumicchannikhilānivānyānyūno navaṃ yauvanamādadhānaḥ| 52ab
dattvā madaṃ yaḥ pramadāmanaḥsu śāntiṃ svakīye manasi vyatārīt|| 52cd

yathā yathāvardhata yauvanaśrīḥ kālendunā yasya vivṛddhibhājā| 53ab
samudraveleva tathā tathoccairuddyoti dṛṣṭaṃ guṇaratnamṛddham|| 53cd

mahendrasampatparibṛṃhitaśrīrāpūryamāṇā vibudhairanekaiḥ| 54ab
dharmyā sudharmeva divo 'vatīrṇā babhau sabhā yasya bhuvi pragalbhā|| 54cd

dharmānukūlau kavirarthakāmau dharmaṃ ca kāmārthakṛtārthayogam| 55ab
trivargamekāntamivaikavargaṃ yo 'sevatodāraphalānubandham|| 55cd

traikālyavijñānavato 'pi yasya sākṣādiveśasya narendramūrteḥ| 56ab
netrīkṛtastattvavicāradakṣaḥ pūṣeva dikṣu pracacāra cāraḥ|| 56cd

itastataḥ svāśrayataḥ samantādāgurguṇā yaṃ svayamanyadīyāḥ| 57ab
gāmbhīryaratnākaramekapātraṃ sattvābhipūrṇaṃ nikhilā ivāpaḥ|| 57cd

yaścāravācopamayānumānārthāpattisaṃvidbhirabhāvayugbhiḥ| 58ab
kāryāṇyakārṣītsatsacca sarvaṃ ṣaḍbhiḥ pramāṇairadhigamyaṃ gamyam|| 58cd

svacchāmbuvāpīkavarīvilāsā vikāsipadmotpalapuñjanetrā| 59ab
mūrteva pūrṇendumukhī diśaḥ śrīryaṃ sevamānā śaradāsasāda|| 59cd

dharmyāṃ dadhāno vibudhārthasiddhiṃ dviṭkāmavidhvaṃsanavidyayāḍhyaḥ| 60ab
rudrādrijāsaṃgamavadyadīyodyogo jajṛmbhe vijayābhijuṣṭaḥ|| 60cd

padmodaye dattaguṇo 'pi yuktyā pūṣeva doṣāvasaraṃ nirasya| 61ab
yantendriyāśvasya bhuvo vibhūtyai saṃmantraṇaṃ mantribhiragrahīdyaḥ|| 61cd

catvāro 'pi mahāgabhīragatayo 'pyāśāsvapi sthāsnavaḥ 
bhūbhṛdbhaṅgakṛto 'pi vardhitatamaiḥ svairvāhinīvistaraiḥ| 62ab
śrījanmāvanayo 'pi kartumapi gāṃ ratnairalaṃ pūritāṃ 
nopāyairjalarāśayo 'tipaṭubhiryasyopameyā jaḍāḥ|| 62cd

ambhodharadhvānagabhīrayā yadvāṇyā kakubbhyastvaritāḥ samantāt| 63ab
samāyayurnadya iva dhvajinyo drākprāvṛṣāveditayātrayāptaiḥ|| 63cd

vyatītavatyāṃ śaradi krameṇa dikcakravālātatabāṣpalakṣyā| 64ab
hemantalakṣmīrabhiṣektumāgādyaṃ yogyamātharvaṇikīva siddhiḥ|| 64cd

suvarṇavarṇaḥ suravo vitīrṇaṃ purodhasā havyamupādadānaḥ| 65ab
pradakṣiṇāvartaśikhaḥ śikhīva dideśa yasmai jayaśabdamuccaiḥ|| 65cd

āmṛtyā dhārayā yaḥ śriyamanupagatakṣīṇabhāvaṃ vivṛddhāṃ 
prāpatkṛtsnārkabimbādiva kalaśaśatātkāladhautātpatantyā| 66ab
puṣye puṣye 'bhiṣikto vidhurupagatavānvṛddhimekārkabimbāt
eva kṣīṇastvabhāgyapravirahitamaho bhavya evāsti bhāgyam|| 66cd

svabhāvataḥ prāgapi kāntimagryāṃ yasya vyatānīdapabhūṣamaṅgam| 67ab
sambaddhasarvābharaṇaṃ tu bhūyaḥ kāmapyabhikhyāmapuṣatprakāmam|| 67cd

satyopamā nūnamanāttaśaktiryasyāṅgakānterbhavituṃ babhūva| 68ab
mithyopamādarśatalaṃ praviṣṭā kandarpakāntiḥ pratibimbaleśā|| 68cd

niḥśeṣabhūmaṇḍalalaṅghanāya yo viṣṇuvadvīkṣitavikramo 'pi| 69ab
nākrāntavānullikhitaṃ pṛthivyāmācāracāruḥ parighaṃ prayāsyan|| 69cd

kakṣyābhiraśvairiva saptabhiryo niryāya yātrānilayodayādreḥ| 70ab
bhāsvānnavīnoditavānbabhāse bhītiṃ nayanvairitamāṃsi dikṣu|| 70cd

dvijādhirājāmalamaṇḍalena sphuṭābhirāśīrbhīrudīritābhiḥ| 71ab
jyotsnābhiriddhābhirivābhiyānārambhe jajṛmbhe kumudākaro yaḥ|| 71cd

saṃghātamekatra didṛkṣuṇeva puñjīkṛtairdaivabalena sainyaiḥ| 72ab
anuprayāto gajavājivṛndasāndraiḥ pratasthe 'rijigīṣayā yaḥ|| 72cd

yāne pṛthorbrahmapadaṃ śriye 'haṃ druteti bhūryasya mudeva yāne| 73ab
bhūtvā rajo 'saṃkhyapadātimardācchrīsampade viṣṇupadaṃ prapede|| 73cd

vyūḍhe 'pi tulyaṃ parakīyasainye yasyaiva senā dadṛśe sasārā| 74ab
upādhinaddhe sphaṭike 'pi gāḍharāge 'sti dīptirna hi pādmarāgī|| 74cd

mandradhvanau garjati yasya cāpe mukteṣuvṛṣṭāvabhavajjigīṣoḥ| 75ab
ārādivārādapi ratnasūrbhūrvidūrabhūreva tu meghabhāre|| 75cd

kṣātrīṃ bhujājjātimajasya jātāṃ yaḥ sādhayāmāsa parairniṣiddhām| 76ab
dṛṣṭaśrutānanyajabāhuvīryādyuddhe 'nyathaivānupapadyamānāt|| 76cd

śauryonnatiryasya hatāhitāsṛgbālapravālodgamalāñchitājau| 77ab
pupoṣa puṣṭā kusumāstraśaktiṃ vasantasamprāptirivāstraśikṣām|| 77cd

sindūradigdhādaridantikumbhātsaṃdhyāpiśaṅgādgaganādivājau| 78ab
tejasvino yasya karāsibhinnātpapāta muktāphalatārakālī|| 78cd

kīlālalākṣāruṇitā vikīrṇabāṇāvataṃsā drutamauktikasrak| 79ab
yaṃ prāptavatyāḥ praharantamāśu reje raṇorvī paṭadhīva lakṣmyāḥ|| 79cd

protāṃ pravīrāriśarīrayaṣṭimandolayitvā diśi nartayantī| 80ab
śaktiryadīyā hṛtatārakāṅgī gauhīva dṛṣṭā nu suraiḥ sarāgam|| 80cd

bhinnāriraktairaruṇā vireje bhujojjvalā yasya raṇe 'sidhārā| 81ab
kīrteḥ prakīrṇeva śikhā samastadvīpaikadīpībhavituṃ jvalantyāḥ|| 81cd

gadābhipiṣṭārikarīndradantakṣodaṃ valakṣaṃ kṣubhitaṃ samīke| 82ab
keśeṣu lakṣmyāḥ suratakṣamāyā yaḥ ketakīkesaravadvitene|| 82cd

tīvrārjunāstrahatabhīṣmavipakṣayuddho yoddhā yudhiṣṭhira ivārkajadīptirodhī| 83ab
yo 'jātaśatruriti bhīmagadāvarugnaduryodhanoruvinipātaraṇāvasānaḥ|| 83cd

pratyastrapātapaṭalairarisamprayuktānyastrāṇyabhedyatanurapyakhilāni roddhā| 84ab
khaḍgāṃstu sadvyajanavadbhramitānmarudbhiruṣmacchido 'sahata yo raṇaraṅgataptaḥ|| 84cd

kṛpāṇapāṇiḥ kṛpaṇe kṛpāluḥ kṛpāṃ vyadhādyo jitavairivīraḥ| 85ab
gaṅgāmbulīne tu na dhārtarāṣṭre cakruḥ kṛpāṃ vyūhamapāsya pārthāḥ|| 85cd

gomaṇḍalasyopakṛtiṃ cikīrṣurunmūlayanbhūmibhṛtaṃ bhujena| 86ab
govardhanaṃ kṛṣṇa ivāspade yo bhūyaḥ svakīye kṛtavānakampyam|| 86cd

snigdhāsipātanakareṇa yathāvakāśaṃ yena sthitāṃ vidalitāṃ svatanuṃ prapaśyan| 87ab
