dānaikārṇavamagnāpi dīptā yajñānalairapi| 202ab
rarājodayamadhyasthā yasya sthitidharā dharā|| 202cd

samastaṃ yo 'karodrāṣṭramabāṣpaṃ namrabhūbhṛtām| 203ab
svasminharastu sahate śvaśure bāṣpavāhinīm|| 203cd

yo vikramatrayāyāsaśaṅkāṃ śārṅgī nu nāśayan| 204ab
cakrāma kṛtsnamekena vikrameṇa punarjagat|| 204cd

tāpanāhlādanakṣatraguṇārkendukarānvitaḥ| 205ab
sandhyodaya ivopāsyo mantriṇāṃ yo 'natikramāt|| 205cd

atasmiṃstaditi prāyaḥ pratyayaṃ heyameva yaḥ| 206ab
guṇeṣu ratnagrahaṇādagrahīdvyasanīkṛtāt|| 206cd

mārica iva rāmasya nāmādyekākṣaraśravāt| 207ab
yasyārirājo vīro 'pi jagāmānanyajāṃ bhiyam|| 207cd

nanākārasvadehārdhasandhyanādariṇāviva| 208ab
śārṅgīśvarau tadardhābhyāṃ yaṃ cakraturatādṛśam|| 208cd

na kevalaṃ padavidhau yadvāgvarṇavidhāvapi| 209ab
vyāpṛtā nopameyaiva samarthaparibhāṣayā|| 209cd

jagatāṃ vardhayanbījaṃ kṣatāttrāṇaṃ vitanvatā| 210ab
nāṅgakāntyaiva jātyāpi yena kāmo vinirjitaḥ|| 210cd

sudakṣiṇāṃ dilīpaṃ yaḥ pratigṛhṇantamadhvare| 211ab
ajaiṣītkṣatradharmeṇa tāṃ pātreṣu tu dattavān|| 211cd

rakṣitaṃ yena saujanyamasādhāraṇabhūṣaṇam| 212ab
ratnaṃ kaustubhanāmeva hṛdyaṃ nārāyaṇorasā|| 212cd

śaptā duṣṭasvareṇaitya dadhīcaṃ svargatā punaḥ| 213ab
yaṃ tu susvaradattāśīrbhāratyadyāpi bhūratā|| 213cd

parākramaparadvandvaṃ yadyaśo 'pi napuṃsakam| 214ab
dikstrīṣu raktaṃ paravalliṅgatvādiva viśrutam|| 214cd

sītāṃ labdhumaśakto 'riryasya maṇḍodarīrataḥ| 215ab
śrīmadādityavidveṣī rāvaṇābho niśācaraḥ|| 215cd

śūnyānātmādivādaṃ yo yuktyā pariharanniva| 216ab
sarvatra vyāpinīmātmavibhūtiṃ pratyapādayat|| 216cd

ya eko 'saṃkhyaguṇavānkutārkikajigīṣayā| 217ab
prādurāsīdguṇaguṇivyatirekaṃ vadanniva|| 217cd

na kevalaṃ gandhavatī kriyate bhūḥ sugandhibhiḥ| 218ab
yaśobhiryasya dikcakrakīrṇairdyaurapyatadguṇā|| 218cd

prākprayujyopasargaṃ yaḥ śāstrajñaḥ pratyayaṃ param| 219ab
dhātoriva riporarthapratipattyai padaṃ vyadhāt|| 219cd

yaśaścandrasya janako daśadiggarbhagāminaḥ| 220ab
anasūyānuyāto yo rarājātririvāparaḥ|| 220cd

purāṇārthānurakto 'pi vṛddhavāṇīpriyo 'pi yaḥ| 221ab
navārtha eva kenāpi kāvye 'rāṃkṣīnmanohare|| 221cd

niṣkale 'pi śive nityasaṃsaktaḥ sakalīkṛte| 222ab
sakalāṃ yaḥ kalāṃ prāpa candrārdho na tu jāḍyataḥ|| 222cd

svīkurvantyunnatiṃ sarvāṃ varṇitā yasya sadguṇāḥ| 223ab
tathā hi lajjāvyājena mukhamapyānataṃ tadā|| 223cd

kaumāraṃ dadhatā yo nu kārtikeyena kevalam| 224ab
jarasā varjitaṃ prāpyamaprāptaṃ prāpa yauvanam|| 224cd

akāryaṃ pṛṣṭhataḥkāramanuśiṣṭā prajākhilā| 225ab
yena priyahitaṃ prājyamanyonyasya vyativyadhāt|| 225cd

tiryakkṛtya kṛtī kṛtyaṃ kṛtsnaṃ prākkṛtibhiḥ kṛtam| 226ab
śāstroktaṃ yaḥ prakṛtavānnavīnamakṛtaṃ paraiḥ|| 226cd

prāpyāhīnānubandhaṃ yadguṇaṃ kīrtīndvalaṃkṛtam| 227ab
naṣṭā harajaṭājūṭaṃ kīrtirgaṅgeva bhūbhujām|| 227cd

yasyāpi nityavīpsārthaṃ kevalaṃ na dvirucyate| 228ab
yaśo 'nuraktaiḥ kavibhiḥ koṭikṛtvo 'pyasambhramaiḥ|| 228cd

etāvatānumeyo yo yoddhā śastravidāṃ varaḥ| 229ab
dviṣaṃ sāṅgamivānaṅgaṃ yaccicchedāsidhārayā|| 229cd

jātāḥ prajāpateryasmāddakṣānmedhādayo daśa| 230ab
daśāṅgāyaiva dharmāya dayitāstasthire sthirāḥ|| 230cd

kāntiṃ dṛṣṭvā punardṛṣṭvā dvau purūravasaḥ purā| 231ab
vibudhāvūcatuḥ kṣīṇāmṛddhāṃ yasya tu te 'khilāḥ|| 231cd

yamasya mahiṣākarṣādivāptuṃ dharmarājatām| 232ab
yasyorvī mahiṣī hṛdyā dakṣiṇāśāṃ sadānvagāt|| 232cd

yasya praśāsato rāṣṭre 'pyaikāgārikavarjite| 233ab
kenāpi dṛṣṭayā kāntyā hṛtaṃ sīmantinīmanaḥ|| 233cd

vṛddhānuśāsanasudhāsindhau magno 'pi yo 'niśam| 234ab
vṛddhabhūpavarāṅgaśrīlaṅghanaṃ caraṇaṃ vyadhāt|| 234cd

rajastamobhyāṃ nirmukto yuktaḥ sarvaguṇairapi| 235ab
prakṛtiryo 'pi buddhyādeḥ paramaḥ puruṣo mataḥ|| 235cd

lakṣaśo lakṣahomāgnau hutaṃ yasyāpi hotṛbhiḥ| 236ab
sarvabījamivāmbūptaṃ mahatphalamajījanat|| 236cd

coditau sūtamagadhau purā tuṣṭuvatuḥ pṛthum| 237ab
stavīti svarasenaiva yaṃ tu sarvamidaṃ jagat|| 237cd

bhūbhṛtyanamre vidhvaste svabhūbhṛttvabhayādiva| 238ab
chinnapakṣāpadeśena namanti girayo nu yam|| 238cd

śrīsomeśvarabhaṭṭādyo mīmāṃsāṃ śrutavāndvijāt| 239ab
budhānvyākhyātavedārthāṃ brahmaṇyānadhyajīgapat|| 239cd

rājapaddhatiradyāpi yatpraṇītā prakāśate| 240ab
yayā yātā nṛpatayo lokadvayahitairyutāḥ|| 240cd

niṣkalaṅkatayā naiva śaśāṅkaṃ prajahāsa yaḥ| 241ab
apakṣapātapūrṇena maṇḍalenāpyaharniśam|| 241cd

rājyaṃ napuṃsakāvasthāmapi prāptaṃ prajarddhikṛt| 242ab
babhau vijitavairīndraṃ yasya jiṣṇorivehitam|| 242cd

bhramitā maṇḍarabhrāntyā lakṣmīramṛtamanthane| 243ab
abhrāntaṃ merumiva yaṃ suvarṇaṃ prāpya susthitā|| 243cd

brahmāṇḍakoṭare 'pi alpe yaśo yenoru darśitam| 244ab
kṛṣṇenevāsyakuhare trailokyaṃ sarvaśaktinā|| 244cd

nītyāśiṣatkambupurīṃ vāgīśasya purodhasaḥ| 245ab
gīrvāṇavāritārīndrāṃ yo vajrīvāmarāvatīm|| 245cd

śamite 'pyanvaśāddurgaṃ durgamaṃ yo 'rimaṇḍale| 246ab
meruṃ kurvantyavadhyā hi dhāma vedhoharīśvarāḥ|| 246cd

pradhānabhūtā bhūteṣu guṇā yasminpraśāsati| 247ab
guṇībhūtāni bhūtāni vyatyayo 'pi mahodayaḥ|| 247cd

śrīkesaraṃ yaśogandhaṃ sāmrājyasarasi sphuṭam| 248ab
yatpādajalajaṃ reje juṣṭaṃ rājanyaṣaṭpadaiḥ|| 248cd

mṛdūcakāra yaḥ śastramasaṃkhyaṃ saṃyati dviṣām| 249ab
harastu kusumāstraikakusumāstramṛdūkṛtaḥ|| 249cd

yasya daṇḍayato 'khaṇḍaṃ daṇḍyāndedīpyate yaśaḥ| 250ab
adaṇḍyādaṇḍanāmbhodherindubimbamivoditam|| 250cd

dattebhaśatadānāmbumatteva vitate 'dhvare| 251ab
paribhramati yatkīrtiradyāpi bhuvanatraye|| 251cd

kamalotkāpi hitvaiva kamalaṃ kaṇṭakānvitam| 252ab
yasyāgādbāhukamalaṃ kamalā hatakaṇṭakam|| 252cd

brahmārthito viśuddho yaḥ śuddha eva śivastvasau| 253ab
śuddhasphaṭikavarṇo 'pi bhūyo 'bhūnnīlalohitaḥ|| 253cd

yatpratāpānalo 'dhākṣīdvāhinyantargatānapi| 254ab
vairiṇaḥ saṃmukhīnānkiṃ punaḥ kāṣṭhāntaradrutān|| 254cd

eka evaikajaladhau prasuptaḥ puruṣottamaḥ| 255ab
yatkīrtyekārṇave stotraprabuddhā bahavastu te|| 255cd

yasya stavāyāpi kaviprayatnānantarīyakam| 256ab
caritāmṛtasamparkātkāvyaṃ na vyeti vedavat|| 256cd

bhītā bhīṣayamāṇe bhūḥ kiṃcidevādiśatpṛthau| 257ab
dattvānyeṣu bahu kṣīraṃ yasmiṃstvabhayade 'khilam|| 257cd

jahatsvārthābhimukhyena parārthapratipādane| 258ab
vṛttiryasya samāsādiriva sāmarthyamaṇḍitā|| 258cd
ekārthībhāvasāmarthya means in 5 vṛttis ekārthībhāvasāmarthyam bhavati. rājapuruṣa iti samāsaḥ. The words together express one total meaning 
vyapekṣāsāmarthyam: you can add viśeṣaṇas
ekārthībhāvasāmarthyaṃ yadi bhavati then you cannot add any viśeṣaṇa in the path. You can not say vṛddhasya rājamātaṅgaḥ
ekārthībhāvasāmarthyamaṇḍitā samāsādirvṛttiriva yasya vṛttirvartate

mokṣaprāptinimittena tattvajñānena bhāsvatā| 259ab
samanvito 'pi yo naiva vimukto hṛdayānnṛṇām|| 259cd

ekatraivātmano gātre vyadhādbhūtiṃ rajomayīm| 260ab
haro yastu jagannāthaḥ saptasvaṅgeṣu sāttvikīm|| 260cd

niṣkāmo 'pi parasveṣu yo vadanyo 'pi pāṭavam| 261ab
dātuṃ nālaṃ svamanyasmai jagrāhānyasya kevalam|| 261cd

jayaḥ parājayo vā syādityāśaṅkānyayoddhṛṣu| 262ab
yasmiṃstu jaya evāsīdasaṃdigdho raṇe raṇe|| 262cd

śrīraho niṣṭhurā yuddhe yatkucābhyāmatāḍayat| 263ab
rugṇanighnadarātībhadantāgraṃ yaduraḥsthalam|| 263cd

nākaukaḥkarakīrṇāsu puṣpavṛṣṭiṣu yo jayī| 264ab
vispardhīvākiradyoddhā kīrtimaṇḍāramañjarīḥ|| 264cd

bhūṣāṃ badhnannivāpūrvāṃ khaṇḍabhūṣe bhave 'dhikām| 265ab
yaśaścandrasahasrāṇi yo 'khaṇḍānyadiśaddiśi|| 265cd

yadvapuḥsahakārasya lagnā kāntiphale nṛṇām| 266ab
dṛgbhṛṅgī kīrtikusumākṛṣṭā nirgantumakṣamā|| 266cd

ātmānamīśvaraṃ vaktuṃ yo vāñchanniva kāraṇam|| 267ab
prakṛtāvanudāsīnaḥ kartavyamakarotkṛtī|| 267cd

devānyaḥ śrīndravarmaśrīyaśovarmādibhirnṛpaiḥ| 268ab
sthāpitānkalpite stheyo yajñāṃśe tairatiṣṭhipat|| 268cd

yaśodharataṭāke śrīyaśovarmakṛte kṛtī| 269ab
adṛṣṭamapi dharmaṃ yaḥ pratyakṣaṃ samadarśayat|| 269cd

kambuviśvambharāyāṃ yastridaśānāṃ svayambhuvām| 270ab
sthāpitānāṃ ca yajvaiko bhūtvā pūjāmavardhayat|| 270cd

rājendunā yena yathā yathā śrībhadreśvare 'dīyata maṇḍalaśrīḥ| 271ab
tathā tathāvardhata niṣkalaṅkā candraśriyaṃ hrepayituṃ mudeva|| 271cd

campādhipaṃ bāhubalena jitvāyacchacchriyaṃ yo haraye tadīyām| 272ab
svayambhuve rodhasi viṣṇupadyāścampeśvarākhyāmiva kartumarthyām|| 272cd

sitānadītīrakṛtāspadāyai dvāratrayaṃ yo 'dita devanadyai| 273ab
yathākhyameṣā tripathena gacchatvitīva haimaṃ saha bhūribhogaiḥ|| 273cd

yaśodharā yena purī parokṣā dharmārthakāmairiyamabhyapūri| 274ab
kṛtvā punarbhāratasaṃhiteva vedaistribhiḥ satyavatīsutena|| 274cd

yācñā yaśovarmanṛpasya yogācāroktavijñaptirivārthaśūnyā|| 275ab
dharmyā svadharmoddharaṇoddhatena yenārthavattāṃ gamitā trayīva|| 275cd

magnānyabhūbhṛtkulamānaśṛṅge 'pyucchrāyabhāgatra taṭākapadme| 276ab
yanmānaviṣṇurbhuvanaṃ vilaṅghya padaṃ vyadhātsūryapadāvadātam|| 276cd

sa śrirājendrabhadreśvara iti viditaṃ liṅgamatredamagryaṃ 
gaurīśaurīśvarāṇāṃ catasṛbhirabhirāmābhirarcābhirābhis| 277ab
kīrtiṃ vaktuṃ prasannaṃ mukhamiva muditasyordhvamāsyaiścaturbhiḥ 
śambhorbhāsvadbhiriddhe śikhitanuvasubhiḥ sthāpayāmāsa śāke|| 277cd

tenāṇimādyairnihito guṇaiḥ śrīrājendravarmeśvara īśvaro 'yam| 278ab
aṣṭābhirindrādibhirātmabhūtyai bhūpālabhāvaḥ sva ivāgnidiksthaḥ|| 278cd

rājendraviśvarūpeśvaro 'pi viśvākṛtirharirhārī| 279ab
tribhuvanakevalakāntiprakara ivākāri tenāsmin|| 279cd

śrīharṣadevajananījayadevyāḥ svarjayāya janitaśrīḥ| 280ab
jananījaghanyajāyāsteneha sthāpitā girijā|| 280cd

rājendravarmadeveśvaramīśvaramīśvaro 'vanīśānām| 281ab
śrīharṣavarmanṛpateranujasya sa bhūtaye kṛtavān|| 281cd

sa dvādaśādhyātmikaliṅgalakṣyāḥ śārṅgyāditārapratimābhirāmāḥ| 282ab
mūrdhenduniṣṭhyūtasudhorudhārā ivāṣṭa mūrtīrakṛtāṣṭamūrteḥ|| 282cd

trailokyalakṣmīriva lokapālairaṣṭābhirāsāditarājabhāvaiḥ| 283ab
puñjīkṛtaiṣu kṣitipena tena deveṣu dattā vividhā vibhūtiḥ|| 283cd

suvarṇabhogī maṇirāśisāndraḥ samudravattatparikalpito 'smin| 284ab
velāṃ vivṛddho 'stvanatītya devapūjāvidhistūryaravorminādaḥ|| 284cd

indreṇa tenādhikṛtaiḥ payodaiḥ puṃbhiḥ svadharmaikarasaṃ pradeyam| 285ab
saṣaḍrasaṃ pātravaśātsamāpya daivīṃ payo divyamivānnamijyām|| 285cd

bhaviṣyataḥ kambujabhūbhuaḥ śrīrājendravarmā vidito vadanyaḥ| 286ab
sa yācate yācata ityudāraṃ rakṣantu dharmaṃ svamimaṃ bhavantaḥ|| 286cd

ātmāyameko bahudhā vibhinne kartopabhoktā ca yataḥ śarīre| 287ab
tataḥ svadharmagrahaṇaṃ budhānāṃ dharmeṣu sarveṣu vivardhatāṃ vaḥ|| 287cd

upādhibhedādapi kartṛbhedo yaḥ kalpitaḥ karmaphalāni bhettum| 288ab
bhāktaḥ sa bhedyaḥ paramārthabuddhyā bhāseva bhānoranayāndhakāraḥ|| 288cd

labdhā dharitrī tapasā bhavadbhirasyāṃ yadastīdamaśeṣametat| 289ab
saṃrakṣaṇīyaṃ kṣaṇamapyupekṣyaṃ na syānnipīḍyeta yadīha kaiścit|| 289cd

kṣatātparitrāṇavidhānaliṅgā kṣatroktireṣābjabhuvo bhujādvaḥ| 290ab
prasūtibhājāṃ bhujavīryabhūribhūṣābhṛtāṃ bhāsayatātsvamartham|| 290cd


nidrāyujāṃ rājyasukhe śriyāpi dharmo vipadyeta yadā tadāstāt| 291ab
prabodhanaṃ vastadupakriyāyai nārāyaṇasyeva payaḥpayodhau|| 291cd

yato nimittādaditeḥ sutatvaṃ straiṇaṃ ca viṣṇurbhagavānajo 'pi| 292ab
śivo jagāmāmbujajanmanaśca tadastu dharmasthitipālanaṃ vaḥ|| 292cd

yamābhyupetā niyamābhirāmā rāmeva sā satyavataḥ priyāstu| 293ab
dattāndhadṛṣṭirdadhatī dhṛtirvo yaśaḥśarīre mama dharmajīvam|| 293cd

ratnādi devasvamidaṃ jighṛkṣurbhūṣāyamāṇaṃ viṣameva kaḥ syāt| 294ab
śrīkaṇṭhakaṇṭhasthitakālakūṭamiveti buddhirviduṣāṃ dṛḍhā vaḥ|| 294d

bhūyāsta yūyaṃ ciramāttarājyā dharmotsukāstyāgaguṇairvariṣṭhāḥ| 295ab
tejodhikāḥ kośabalarddhimantaḥ karandhamādyā iva pūrvabhūpāḥ|| 295cd

kulīnamutkā kulajeva kanyā bhavadvidhaṃ prāpya patiṃvaraiṣā| 296ab
śālīnatāṃ mārdavamānayantī yācñā nijāṃ no vivṛṇoti bhāvam|| 296cd

svargāpavargapraśamaikavīthī vāṇī mamaiṣeśvaramūrdhamāla| 297ab
gambhīramānandayatāṃ mano vo mandākinīvāmbunidhiṃ praviṣṭā|| 297cd

maraṇamidaminānāṃ yācanaṃ yuktamuktaṃ 
kṛtibhirabhimatārthaprāptaye yatprayuktam| 298ab
tadamṛtamanugamyaṃ dharmasaṃvardhanārthaṃ 
yadabhimatamato 'haṃ dharmarāgeṇa yāce|| 298cd




